WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,500
Violence is higher than what is said online

2
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:20,290
But it cannot be taken as inevitable and we will continue to warn everyone.

3
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:25,020
I'll blow you off when you're in danger, but don't hold on

4
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:40,050
Fan Jiawen and I will go in and help you, right, little lady?

5
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:41,330
Multiple points of protection for multiple people

6
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:48,770
If you don't let Xiao Fan and Xiao Su go in, I can take care of you. No need.

7
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,520
Too many people will make it slower. I will come out as soon as I finish collecting.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:57,280
Then you blow the whistle whenever something happens. I counted the number, just right, Sister Wang.

9
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,240
Share the rest with Xiao Yunchuan
